Answer availability checked on 28 October 2026: bounded official Oxford searches by exact year, paper label and both course names found no advertised exact-paper answers. The https://www.maths.ox.ac.uk/system/files/attachments/PartC%202009-10.pdf[official syllabus for the 2010 examination] identifies the combined unit. No later answer-release policy was assumed applicable.

